  "html": "<article id=\"post-6835\" class=\"container post-6835 page type-page status-publish hentry\">\n\n\t<div class=\"entry-content | container\">\n\t\t<section  class=\"container section--services-hero pt-5 services-hero\">\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main\">\n\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__left\">\n                <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-2c90304e wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img title=\"Wells Fargo Logo - Russell’s American Mechanical\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"500\" height=\"500\" src=\"/images/2024/07/Wells-Fargo-Logo.png\" alt=\"Wells Fargo Logo\" class=\"wp-image-6222\" style=\"width:auto;height:55px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/07/Wells-Fargo-Logo.png 500w, /images/2024/07/Wells-Fargo-Logo-300x300.png 300w, /images/2024/07/Wells-Fargo-Logo-150x150.png 150w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 500px) 100vw, 500px\" /></figure>\n\n<figure class=\"wp-block-image size-full is-resized\"><img title=\"Synchrony Bank logo - Russell’s American Mechanical\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"1408\" height=\"300\" src=\"/images/2024/06/Synchrony-Bank-logo.png\" alt=\"Synchrony Bank logo\" class=\"wp-image-5817\" style=\"width:auto;height:55px\" srcset=\"/images/2024/06/Synchrony-Bank-logo.png 1408w, /images/2024/06/Synchrony-Bank-logo-300x64.png 300w, /images/2024/06/Synchrony-Bank-logo-1024x218.png 1024w, /images/2024/06/Synchrony-Bank-logo-768x164.png 768w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1408px) 100vw, 1408px\" /></figure>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group h-align is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-7387b849 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">    <div class=\"iconblock wp-elements-1 has-background has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-primary-inverse-color\" data-size=\"md\" data-padding=\"2\" data-display=\"inline\">\n        <svg class=\"icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-money\" /></svg>    </div>\n\n<h1 class=\"wp-block-heading has-x-large-font-size\">Plumbing Service Financing</h1>\n</div>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">*Subject to credit approval. Ask us for details.</p>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group my-3 is-layout-flex wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">At Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical, we know that plumbing repairs or upgrades can be unexpected expenses. That’s why we’ve partnered with <strong>Wells Fargo</strong> and <strong>Synchrony Bank</strong> to offer flexible financing options. Whether you’re repairing a burst pipe, replacing a water heater, or upgrading your fixtures, our financing plans help you get the service you need without financial stress. Contact us today to learn more about our financing options for plumbing services.</p>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group mb-3 is-content-justification-left is-nowrap is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-a1b15d37 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<div class=\"wp-block-group full-width-mobile is-vertical is-content-justification-stretch is-layout-flex wp-container-core-group-is-layout-41171c72 wp-block-group-is-layout-flex\">\n<p class=\"horizon-text full-width-mobile has-secondary-font-family wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\">Talk to a Specialist</p>\n\n<a href=\"tel:+17575254911\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"icon\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta full-width-mobile\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span>(757) 525-4911</span>\n</a>\n\n<p class=\"text-center has-primary-color has-text-color has-link-color has-secondary-font-family has-small-font-size wp-elements-2 wp-block-paragraph\" style=\"text-transform:uppercase\"><strong>Same-day appointments available by phone</strong></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n\n</div>\n\t\t\t</div><!-- ./left -->\n\t\t\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main__row__right\">\n\t\t\t<div class=\"elevated content-fullbleed-mobile box-shadow-lg border-radius-lg\" >\n    <div class=\"acf-innerblocks-container\">\n\t\t\t<figure class=\"wp-block-post-featured-image\"><img decoding=\"async\" width=\"1917\" height=\"1280\" src=\"/images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-talking-with-a-customer.jpg\" class=\"attachment-full size-full\" alt=\"A Russell’s American Mechanical technician talking with a customer\" srcset=\"/images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-talking-with-a-customer.jpg 1917w, /images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-talking-with-a-customer-300x200.jpg 300w, /images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-talking-with-a-customer-1024x684.jpg 1024w, /images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-talking-with-a-customer-768x513.jpg 768w, /images/2024/06/A-Russells-American-Mechanical-technician-talking-with-a-customer-1536x1026.jpg 1536w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 1917px) 100vw, 1917px\" title=\"A Russell’s American Mechanical technician talking with a customer - Russell’s American Mechanical\" /></figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n</div>\t\t\t</div><!-- ./right -->\n\t\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</div>\n\t<div class=\"section--services-hero__main section--services-hero__main--empty has-background has-secondary-background-color\">\n\t</div><!-- ./row -->\n\n</section>\n\n<div class=\"wp-block-group container pb-5 flow has-primary-inverse-color has-secondary-background-color has-text-color has-background has-link-color wp-elements-3\">\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\"></p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Plumbing Services in Norfolk, VA</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Plumbing repairs and installations are critical to keeping your home safe and functional. Costs vary depending on the service, with plumbing solutions in Norfolk, VA, typically ranging from <strong>$200 to $5,000</strong>. From simple repairs to full-system upgrades, our team ensures you get quality service at competitive prices. Contact Russell’s American Mechanical today for a free estimate.</p>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Financing with Wells Fargo and Synchrony Bank</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Through partnerships with Wells Fargo and Synchrony Bank, we provide financing options to help you manage the cost of plumbing services:</p>\n\n<ul class=\"wp-block-list\">\n<li><strong>Low Monthly Payments:</strong> Spread out the cost of your plumbing services over time.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Promotional Offers:</strong> Enjoy special financing rates during promotional periods.</li>\n\n<li><strong>Quick Approvals:</strong> Get fast approval, so you don’t have to delay essential plumbing repairs.</li>\n\n<li><a href=\"https://retailservices.wellsfargo.com/ahapp/init-app?m=0024334237&amp;l=en_US\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Apply with Wells Fargo</a></li>\n\n<li><a href=\"https://www.mysynchrony.com/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Apply with Synchrony Bank</a></li>\n</ul>\n\n<h2 class=\"wp-block-heading\">Why Choose Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical?</h2>\n\n<p class=\"wp-block-paragraph\">Russell&#8217;s American Mechanical is proud to serve Norfolk and the surrounding areas with reliable plumbing solutions. Our experienced technicians, combined with flexible financing options through trusted partners, ensure you receive high-quality service at a price you can manage. Let us help you address your plumbing needs today.</p>\n\n<a href=\"/contact-us\" data-cta-gap=\"md\" data-cta-type=\"solid\" data-cta-content=\"mixed\" data-cta-level=\"primary\" data-cta-minwidth=\"true\" class=\"cta align-self-center\">\n    <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-phone\" /></svg><span >Contact Us Today</span>\n        <svg class=\"icon cta-icon\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#icon-chevronright\" /></svg>\n</a></div>\n\t</div>\n\t</article><!-- #post-6835 -->"
